References: <2V9c96FM1po.-o990c3kBwAJ@rpackageggir.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rpackageggir/c/2V9c96FM1po/m/z5Gf-g8QCAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
